Now we need to have cargo_available for loading; we have initially cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha. After loading origin payload, cargo becomes unavailable; after unload origin, cargo becomes available again. Then we load destination payload (cargo becomes unavailable), then unload destination (cargo becomes available). So after both load/unload sequences, cargo will be available again.

But we also need loading_container_loaded loading_container_beta (goal). That requires loading container to be loaded onto leg, which does not involve cargo_payload. So cargo availability not needed for that.

