Thus steps:

- Prepare origin (allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm_preparedness)
- Activate origin node
- Load origin payload
- Unload origin payload (gives locked+confirmed, occupied+ready)
- Prepare destination (allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm_preparedness)
- Activate destination node
- Load destination payload
- Unload destination payload (gives locked+confirmed, occupied+ready)
- Attach task profile to origin (if not already done) Actually we need origin task profile linked for authorize loading. We'll do that early.
- Authorize transport leg loading
- Assemble transport leg (requires origin/destination locked+confirmed, nodes ready, transport_leg_available)
- Then we can load container onto leg (load_container_onto_leg) using shift_beta's loading container beta.

