Thus we need shift_beta prepared before loading container.

Thus we need to prepare shift_beta (allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm_preparedness) before we can load container onto leg.

But we also need shift_beta to have operator linked, skill certificate linked, compliance certificate linked, staged for loading, loading verified, clearance established, finalized, dispatch allocated, dispatched.

